       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LYAPUNOV-BOUND.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LYAPUNOV-BOUND-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SINGULAR-INTERCEPT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ACCUMULATOR-REDIRECT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENERGY-CLAMPING-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HARMONIC-DAMPING-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LYAPUNOV-BOUND-SEAL-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LYAPUNOV-BOUND-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-BOUND-PROVEN         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BOUND-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-INTERCEPT-AND-REDIRECT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CLAMPING-AND-DAMPING.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-BOUND-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-INTERCEPT-AND-REDIRECT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SINGULAR-INTERCEPT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ACCUMULATOR-REDIRECT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CLAMPING-AND-DAMPING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENERGY-CLAMPING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HARMONIC-DAMPING-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-BOUND-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SINGULAR-INTERCEPT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ACCUMULATOR-REDIRECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ENERGY-CLAMPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HARMONIC-DAMPING-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LYAPUNOV-BOUND-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-BOUND-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-BOUND-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-BOUND-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-BOUND-CODE.
